      "body": "Jolly Plastic Industries Limited (BSE:507968) entered into a share purchase agreement to acquire Sahaj Retail Limited from Bhaum Digital Ventures Private Limited for approximately INR 440 million on January 21, 2026. The consideration consists of 17.7 million common equity of Jolly Plastic Industries Limited to be issued for common equity of Sahaj Retail Limited. Jolly Plastic will issue 354 equity shares against every 10 equity shares of Sahaj Retail Limited.\r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to approval by regulatory board / committee and approval of offer by acquirer shareholders.",
